    "updated_at": "2025-04-17T14:28:42Z",
    "body": "For content-visibility, right before step 15 makes sense to me. I'm agnostic as to whether this text should be in HTML. I have a slight preference in keeping all of the elaborations in css-contain-2. Maybe we can add an exported name in HTML and reference that in CSS instead of hardcoding step numbers? (Thanks to @dbaron for that suggestion)",
