    "created_at": "2025-04-18T09:48:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T09:48:21Z",
    "body": "Thanks for the input on the location!\n\nIn general we prefer not to have monkey patch specs. See https://annevankesteren.nl/2014/02/monkey-patch and https://w3ctag.github.io/design-principles/#monkey-patching . So it's quite inappropriate to have CSS modify the HTML rendering steps, and we definitely need to move it.",
